    "A_specificity": "\nWhen answering, always include the specific CPR Part number or rule reference from the sources (e.g. \"CPR Part 24\", \"CPR 35.3\"). Include specific time limits, deadlines, and procedural thresholds mentioned in the sources. Use the precise legal terminology from the sources alongside any plain-English explanation.",
